stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_auth: checkAdmin()
    q_auth --> q_parse: parsedData = teamSchema.safeParse(values)
    q_auth --> q_error: checkAdmin throws
    q_parse --> q_invalid: parsedData.success == false or id missing
    q_parse --> q_update: parsedData.success == true and id present
    q_invalid --> [*]: return error "Invalid data", team null
    q_update --> q_db_update: supabaseAdmin.from("teams").update(name, discord_role_id).eq("id", id).select().single()
    q_db_update --> q_db_error: update error
    q_db_update --> q_revalidate: update success, updatedTeam returned
    q_db_error --> q_error: throw error
    q_revalidate --> [*]: revalidatePath, return team
    q_error --> [*]: return error message, team null

    note right of q_parse
        INV-001: Admin check precedes any mutation
        INV-002: Both schema validation AND id presence are required
        INV-003: Update is scoped to exact team id via .eq("id", id)
    end note
